Implement three loops:
```
float acc = 0.0;
uint nblk = pc.cols >> 7;
uint row = gl_GlobalInvocationID.x;
for (uint b = 0u; b < nblk; ++b) {
    uint base = (row * nblk + b) * 28u;
    float d = unpackHalf2x16(b8(base+26u) | (b8(base+27u) << 8u)).x;
    uint xb = b * 128u;
